- lock_destination_availability: similar.

- assemble_transport_leg: parameters: ?origin_availability - origin_candidate_availability ?destination_availability - destination_candidate_availability ?origin_node - origin_node ?destination_node - destination_node ?transport_leg - transport_leg. Good.

- authorize_transport_leg_loading: ?transport_leg - transport_leg ?origin_availability - origin_candidate_availability ?route_task_profile - route_task_profile. Good.

- mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready: ?origin_availability - origin_candidate_availability ?transport_leg - transport_leg. Good.

- allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate: ?candidate - candidate_entity ?dispatch_slot - dispatch_slot ?route_task_profile - route_task_profile. Good.

- execute_origin_dispatch: ?origin_availability - origin_candidate_availability ?vehicle_unit - vehicle_unit ?dispatch_slot - dispatch_slot. Good.

- detach_task_profile: ?candidate - candidate_entity ?route_task_profile - route_task_profile. Good.

